# -------------------------------------------------------------------
# .gitattributes — rspress-plugin-obsidian
# -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Line endings are part of this package's contract: the markdown and canvas
# parsers split on "\n", the tests assert exact "\n"-joined strings, and the
# snapshot fixtures are LF. `core.autocrlf=true` — the default most Windows
# installers write — rewrites every text blob to CRLF on checkout, so a
# Windows contributor would see the suite fail against files they never
# touched. `eol=lf` takes precedence over that config, so the checkout is
# byte-identical on all three platforms.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Assets must never be text-normalised: `text=auto` is a heuristic, and a CRLF
# rewrite (or a line-wise diff/merge) corrupts the bytes. `binary` is the
# `-text -diff` macro. Images and PDFs are what the repo tracks today; fonts are
# the other asset a theme ships beside its stylesheets — the docs build already
# copies KaTeX's woff/woff2/ttf files into `doc_build/static/font`.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
